    - "check contains executable verification entry"
  step:
    - "trigger: user runs impl_code_draft command"
    - "process: load planned draft items and execute implementation pipeline"
    - "result: update draft item progress and persist execution/check records"
  tasks:
    - "parse and validate target draft items for implementation eligibility"
    - "execute implementation routine for each planned draft item"
    - "persist state/log updates to project artifacts after execution"
    - "return structured result for succeeding/failing items"
  constraints:
    - "draft item 입력 -> 구현 실행 결과 출력 : planned 상태 항목만 구현 대상으로 처리"
